<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>通知悬浮气泡</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>通知悬浮气泡 · 测试版 0.22.0</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>收到未读消息时图标伸出并停留约 1 秒后收回。只要有 App 处于 TrollOpen 分屏，整排气泡都保持伸出、不再收回；键盘弹出时气泡若处于伸出状态则自动缩回让位，键盘收起后重新弹出。点击执行通知或 App 打开动作；若该 App 没有未读通知且正占据 TrollOpen 分屏浮窗，则单击将该分屏窗口放大到全屏。长按：分屏浮窗对应的图标长按无任何动作；其余图标长按后气泡破裂消失，同时该 App 退出后台（进程终止）。双击不绑定任何操作。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用悬浮气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示位置</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>锁屏关闭仅隐藏气泡，通知仍会收集，进入允许显示的桌面或 App 后出现。总开关关闭会清理全部图标。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>锁屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnLock</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>主屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnHome</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>App 内显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowInApps</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>整组图标上下位置</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>VerticalPosition</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0.7</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标外观</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>大小范围 32–80 点，默认 48 点；不透明度范围 20%–100%，越低越透明。修改即时生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标大小</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconSize</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>48</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>32</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>80</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标不透明度</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconOpacity</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.2</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>气泡与角标</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>图标从下往上排列，最下面是第一位；当前 App 自动排在第一位。位置滑块 0 为顶部、1 为底部。当前浮窗图标保持伸出：无待处理通知时点击返回 App 内上一页（等同边缘右滑返回），有通知时优先打开通知；长按当前浮窗图标切换窗口方向（竖屏/横屏），等同绿色交互条长按旋转；双击当前浮窗图标关闭该分屏窗口，双击其它图标无操作。系统关闭通知的 App 不显示通知来源图标，切换器图标不受影响。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>清除全部气泡</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>clearBubbles</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
